<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<xliff xmlns="urn:oasis:names:tc:xliff:document:2.0" xmlns:swi18n="https://step-wise.com/ns/i18n" version="2.1" srcLang="en" trgLang="de">
	<file id="catalog">
		<group id="notifications">
			<unit id="groupsLoading">
				<segment>
					<source>Groups are being loaded...</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="2a8ecf0c5ec9a6a0" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Gruppen werden geladen...</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<unit id="groupsLoadingError">
				<segment>
					<source>Oops ... something went wrong when loading the groups.</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="144c050eccbd780f" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Ups ... beim Laden der Gruppen ist etwas schiefgegangen.</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
		</group>
		<group id="createGroup">
			<unit id="title">
				<segment>
					<source>New practice group</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="009542480db921a0" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Neue Übungsgruppe</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<unit id="step1">
				<segment>
					<source>Create a group code/link.</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="837dc99deb7fc6a8" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Erstelle einen Gruppencode/Link.</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<unit id="step2">
				<segment>
					<source>Share it with fellow students.</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="d64c9ce839aa1087" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Teile ihn mit deinen Kommilitonen.</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<unit id="step3">
				<segment>
					<source>Practice with the same exercises.</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="5fba4164c7b4b76f" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Mache die gleichen Übungen zusammen.</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<unit id="confirmationButton">
				<segment>
					<source>Create new practice group</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="98e3eb41773834d4" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Neue Übungsgruppe erstellen</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
		</group>
		<group id="newGroup">
			<unit id="paragraph1">
				<segment>
					<source>You are about to create a new practice group. This will give you a code/link to share with your fellow students. Each person entering the code will get access to the practice group. This includes:</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="d7baa1eed4d7d2d2" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Du bist dabei, eine neue Übungsgruppe zu erstellen. Du erhältst einen Code/Link, den du mit deinen Kommilitonen teilen kannst. Jeder, der den Code eingibt, erhält Zugang zur Übungsgruppe. Dies beinhaltet</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<unit id="paragraph2">
				<segment>
					<source>You can always leave and/or forget a practice group. Upon forgetting a practice group, all your traces from the group will be permanently erased.</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="2dcda5e76fbd4a36" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Du kannst eine Übungsgruppe jederzeit verlassen und/oder vergessen. Wenn du eine Übungsgruppe vergisst, werden alle deine Spuren aus dieser Übungsgruppe dauerhaft gelöscht.</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<unit id="agreeButton">
				<segment>
					<source>Yes, I agree</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="c46197863411e43e" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Ja, ich stimme zu</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<unit id="disagreeButton">
				<segment>
					<source>No, I don't want that</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="7d223fa48a4e3c15" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Nein, das will ich nicht.</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
		</group>
		<group id="groupPossibilities">
			<unit id="entry1">
				<segment>
					<source>See who is active in the group and whether they are online/active.</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="21e121db3bffe008" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Sehen, wer in der Gruppe ist und ob sie online/aktiv sind.</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<unit id="entry2">
				<segment>
					<source>At exercises: view the submissions of other group members.</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="0b72550a779cccc0" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Für Übungen: Eingaben von Gruppenmitgliedern ansehen.</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<unit id="entry3">
				<segment>
					<source>Get suggestions on which skill is best to practice, also based on the level of other active group members.</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="1094d84a859a7a77" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Hinweise darauf erhalten, welche Kompetenz angesichts des Niveaus der aktiven Gruppenmitglieder sinnvoll zu üben ist.</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
		</group>
		<group id="olderGroups">
			<unit id="title">
				<segment>
					<source>Previous groups</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="8bb1e6d8e087e9b1" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Vorherige Gruppen</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<unit id="code">
				<segment>
					<source>Code</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="02c0fd6c912d9327" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Code</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<unit id="forgetGroup">
				<segment>
					<source>Forget this group</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="15c1c4b5da9a2d6c" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Vergiss diese Gruppe</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
		</group>
		<group id="activeGroup">
			<unit id="activeGroup">
				<segment>
					<source>Your active group: <pc id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:link" swi18n:slot="children"><ph id="x1" type="ui" subType="xlf:var" swi18n:name="code"/></pc></source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="a3dee1f0aa91e3df" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="3f26e640386cf809">Deine aktive Gruppe: <pc id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:link" swi18n:slot="children"><ph id="x1" type="ui" subType="xlf:var" swi18n:name="code"/></pc></target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<unit id="emptyGroup">
				<segment>
					<source>There is no one else in group <pc id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:link" swi18n:slot="children"><ph id="x1" type="ui" subType="xlf:var" swi18n:name="code"/></pc>. Share the code/<pc id="c2" type="ui" subType="swi18n:link" swi18n:slot="children">link</pc> with your fellow students to practice together.</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="0bdc8acef44ef5aa" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="a1a9023fc7e873e6">Es ist noch niemand in Gruppe <pc id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:link" swi18n:slot="children"><ph id="x1" type="ui" subType="xlf:var" swi18n:name="code"/></pc>. Gib den Code/<pc id="c2" type="ui" subType="swi18n:link" swi18n:slot="children">Link</pc> an deine Kommilitonen weiter, um gemeinsam zu üben.</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<unit id="deactivateButton">
				<segment>
					<source>Leave this group</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="c0df58d73a10e3e6" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Verlasse diese Gruppe</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
		</group>
		<group id="indicator">
			<unit id="noOthers">
				<segment>
					<source>No other group members are present yet.</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="6cc5b53acc136054" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Es sind noch keine anderen anwesend.</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<unit id="others">
				<segment>
					<source>You are working together with <ph id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:localized-list"/>.</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="05759c279c4b7150" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="cf74ad102bd1727e">Du arbeitest mit <ph id="c1" type="ui" subType="swi18n:localized-list"/> zusammen.</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
		</group>
		<group id="joinGroup">
			<unit id="title">
				<segment>
					<source>Join existing group</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="52c1eea1e9446b22" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Bestehende Gruppe beitreten</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<unit id="instruction">
				<segment>
					<source>Enter an existing group code.</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="1aa31c8722b56ff0" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Gib einen bestehenden Gruppencode ein.</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<unit id="fieldLabel">
				<segment>
					<source>Group code</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="8c377b2cabd38f7c" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Gruppencode</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<unit id="confirmationButton">
				<segment>
					<source>Become a group member</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="5e73e33f1fc10a63" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Der Gruppe beitreten</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<group id="feedback">
				<unit id="numberOfCharacters">
					<segment>
						<source>Codes must have four characters.</source>
						<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="a4fc5168930d848d" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Codes haben immer vier Zeichen.</target>
					</segment>
				</unit>
				<unit id="useLettersNumbers">
					<segment>
						<source>Only use letters/numbers.</source>
						<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="ff023f894b2f8c4b" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Verwende nur Buchstaben/Zahlen.</target>
					</segment>
				</unit>
				<unit id="nonexistingGroup">
					<segment>
						<source>This group code does not exist.</source>
						<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="e635c6437e9cc525" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Der Gruppencode existiert nicht.</target>
					</segment>
				</unit>
			</group>
		</group>
		<group id="joinGroupConditions">
			<unit id="paragraph1">
				<segment>
					<source>You are about to join the practice group <ph id="x1" type="ui" subType="xlf:var" swi18n:name="code"/>. This will allow you to:</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="7b42f739916548d1" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ce32a78035d0ac4">Du bist dabei, der Übungsgruppe <ph id="x1" type="ui" subType="xlf:var" swi18n:name="code"/> beizutreten. Du kannst dann:</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<unit id="paragraph2">
				<segment>
					<source>All current and future members of the practice group are of course also able to do so. You can always leave and/or forget a practice group. If you leave a practice group, all your traces from this group will be permanently erased.</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="a0c545a7414ad5ef" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Alle derzeitigen und zukünftigen Mitglieder dieser Übungsgruppe können dies natürlich auch tun. Du kannst eine Übungsgruppe jederzeit verlassen und/oder vergessen. Wenn du eine Übungsgruppe vergisst, werden alle deine Spuren in der Übungsgruppe dauerhaft gelöscht.</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<unit id="agreeButton">
				<segment>
					<source>Yes, I agree</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="c46197863411e43e" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Ja, ich stimme zu</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
			<unit id="disagreeButton">
				<segment>
					<source>No, I don't want that</source>
					<target swi18n:sourceContentFingerprint="7d223fa48a4e3c15" swi18n:sourceStructureFingerprint="5ecb3f106fbb7f40">Nein, das will ich nicht.</target>
				</segment>
			</unit>
		</group>
	</file>
</xliff>
